      "content": "Tags or ornaments at the ends of laces, ribbons, or points that tie garments or footwear. Also refers to any of various ornamental tags, studs, or plates worn on costume; may be at pendent end of a cord or similar object or sewn directly onto garments or headgear. [Source: Getty AAT]"
    }
